### =====================================================
### Unlink Unit - POST /account/unlink
### Desvincula la unidad (por número de serie) del usuario
### autenticado y revoca la sesión asociada
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Desvincular unidad por número de serie (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/unlink
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "ABC123DEF456"
}

### Test 2: Sin token — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/unlink
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "ABC123DEF456"
}

### Test 3: Campo requerido faltante (sin serialNumber) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/unlink
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Test 4: SerialNumber vacío — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/unlink
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "   "
}

### Test 5: Número de serie inexistente — 500 (error del SP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/unlink
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SERIE_INEXISTENTE_999999999"
}
